<!-- rocky-mem:start -->
## rocky-mem

Consult the engineering experience ledger before non-trivial work.

- Before debugging/design/ops work: call `mem_search` with the symptom or error
  text. Read `## Preferences` as constraints, verify `Applies when` /
  `Do not apply when`, treat `## Do not use` as hard negatives.
- After a reusable lesson: `mem_record` with at least one evidence item.
  `pending_review` is not success — report the real status.
- When reality contradicts an entry: `mem_feedback` with `outcome=wrong` and a
  short note.
- Do not record guesses, credentials, or one-off trivia.
<!-- rocky-mem:end -->
